      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Even when asleep, Lucia remained austere and tense. I didn’t think any substance would relax her, even if she tried",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 103
        }
      ],
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The Otherside wasn’t a physical location, after all. It was in between, a dimension of pure energy. A transition, if you",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 464
        }
      ],
      "words": 22
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "This wasn’t guaranteed to work. I had returned to my world, yet there was still a chance she would not choose to stay. T",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 970
        }
      ],
      "words": 33
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "She was rude, demanding, uncouth—and yet she had left as permanent a mark on my soul as I had to her skin",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1296
        }
      ],
      "words": 22
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Lucia, I hope you choose to stay,” I whispered in her ear",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1610
        },
        {
